"This is an international purchase and excludes a 3.5% IOF fee. By proceeding, you acknowledge and accept <terms>Ebanx’s terms and conditions</terms>." = "Tai – tarptautinis pirkinys, kuriam netaikomas 3,5 % IOF mokestis. Tęsdami, patvirtinate ir sutinkate su <terms>„Ebanx“ sąlygomis ir nuostatomis</terms>.";
/* Text of a label indicating that a payment method is the default. */
"This is your default" = "Tai jūsų numatytasis mokėjimo būdas";
